# regression-report.md — Template Definition

## Expression

- Checklist-style result record
- Each item with evidence
- Takes effect only after user confirmation

## Section Hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Regression report

### H2 (required)
- Execution result table: ID / feature / result / evidence
- Red-green result table: ID / target / result

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional Sections

- [optional] Failed items detail table: ID / item / cause / disposition
- [optional] User confirmation record: item / date
